'''Rock Paper Shears''' is an {{Uncommon}} item that allows players to play a renamed game of [[w:Rock_paper_scissors|Rock Paper Scissors]] on their {{Zone|Private Island}} with their guests.

It is a {{Skl|Social}} item that can be bought from {{NPCSprite|Amelia}} in the [[Hub]] for {{c|10,000}} with the requirement of {{Skill|Social|8}}.

